  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 502.20 Final project cost",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 502.20 “Final project cost” means the dollar amount of eligible project expenditures plus any outstanding interest on the loan accrued during project planning, design, or construction.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1-#3 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 500) #10984, eff 12-1-15; ss by #13511, eff 12-20-22 (formerly Env-Wq 502.19)",
